<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 14.93 to 7672.79.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.86 to 462.44.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1523 to 1281.</p>
<p>Volume was 561,404,080 compared with 469,700,830 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
